  "notes": "{区別|くべつ} means to distinguish or differentiate between things.\n\nTRANSITIVITY (as suru verb):\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: A⟦と→と：00512_to⟧B⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{区別|くべつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (distinguish A from B)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- A⟦と→と：00512_to⟧B⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{区別|くべつ} (distinction between A and B)\n- {区別|くべつ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦つく→付く：01960_tsuku⟧/⟦つかない→付く：01960_tsuku⟧ (can/cannot tell apart)\n- {区別|くべつ}⟦なく→ない：01118_nai⟧ (without distinction)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{違|ちが}い→違い：03432_chigai⟧: difference (the actual difference itself)\n- ⟦{差別|さべつ}→差別：01633_sabetsu⟧: discrimination (often negative, unfair treatment)",
